# Build context trimming for the C engine image.
#
# `make clean` (run as the first build step) wipes bin/, tests/googletest,
# and every *.a anyway, and `tests/tests-setup` re-clones googletest from
# scratch — so none of those local artifacts belong in the context. Keep
# src/, Makefile, and tests/ (sans googletest); the build runs `make all &&
# make test`, which proves the remaining context is sufficient.

# VCS
.git
.gitignore

# Prebuilt local binaries (make clean deletes bin/ on the first build step)
bin/

# Compiled objects / static libs (rebuilt from source)
*.o
*.a
*.exe

# Vendored json-c build output (rebuilt by `make json-c`)
src/vendor/json-c/build/

# GoogleTest is re-cloned by tests/tests-setup at build time
tests/googletest/

# Cruft
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store

# Not needed to build or test the engine
research/
games/
GOMOCUP-README.txt
